ca.append(M(A,13,'Particle motion in a travelling wave','C.2','A transverse wave travels in the positive $x$ direction at $5.0\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}$. At point P the instantaneous spatial gradient $\\Delta y/\\Delta x$ is $-0.080$. For a small time interval, the wave profile translates without changing shape. What is the instantaneous transverse velocity of P?', ['$0.40\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}$ upward','$0.40\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}$ downward','$0.016\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}$ upward','$5.0\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}$ upward'],'During $\\Delta t$, the profile moves right by $v\\Delta t$. At fixed position P, $\\Delta y\\approx-(\\Delta y/\\Delta x)v\\Delta t$, so the transverse velocity is $-5.0(-0.080)=+0.40\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}$. A negative spatial slope in a right-moving wave means upward particle motion.','6.pdf',6,'13','Wave-profile direction and particle velocity',svg(line(90,190,510,190)+line(90,50,90,230)+line(140,70,440,214)+circle(290,142,4)+text(305,137,'P',15)+arrow(360,45,470,45,'wave motion')+text(420,255,'x',15)+text(60,45,'y',15)),))
ca.append(M(A,14,'Changing source phase','C.3','Two coherent loudspeakers initially emit in phase at wavelength $0.40\\,\\mathrm{m}$. Point P is $2.4\\,\\mathrm{m}$ from one speaker and $3.0\\,\\mathrm{m}$ from the other; the arriving amplitudes are equal. One speaker is then shifted by half a cycle. What happens at P?', ['Destructive interference changes to constructive interference.','Constructive interference changes to destructive interference.','It stays destructive because the distances do not change.','Interference disappears because the frequencies are now different.'],'The path difference is $0.60\\,\\mathrm{m}=1.5\\lambda$, so initially the waves arrive half a cycle out of phase. An additional half-cycle source shift makes the arrival phase difference a whole number of cycles, giving constructive interference. A fixed phase shift does not change frequency or coherence.','6.pdf',7,'14','Path difference and coherent interference',svg(circle(100,75,18,'S1')+circle(100,210,18,'S2')+line(120,75,485,140)+line(120,210,485,140)+circle(485,140,4)+text(500,145,'P',16)+text(300,75,'2.4 m',15,'middle')+text(300,215,'3.0 m',15,'middle'),600,270)))
